# Cargo build tree. The Rust core that owned this was removed in 0.3.5 and it
# carried its own .gitignore, so nothing at the root covered `target/` — and a
# leftover worktree from `core/rust-hybrid` still has 223 MB in it. Anchored to
# `local_plugins/` because a `target/` in git is only ever Rust build output here.
local_plugins/**/target/
# …and the LiteRT-LM C API headers it fetched into vendor/prebuilt/, same reason:
# they are downloaded by a script, not committed. Left ignored so a worktree that
# still has them cannot commit them by accident.
local_plugins/mobilelm_core/vendor/prebuilt/

